{"unit_id":"cayan0x__Lume#card-zh","repo":"cayan0x/Lume","commit":"67e988d097f3682603d8fbee07185a7394a8349f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Lume（DSH 插件，web 客户端）：为 DSH Desktop 提供可切换的人设、长期记忆与风格学习。它在输入栏加入人设选择、管理和蒸馏入口，并通过宿主工具和提示词注入保存及使用人设数据。主要功能包括从聊天或其他文本蒸馏自定义人设、跨会话记忆用户偏好与关系、记录表达风格要求，以及管理记忆和导入导出角色卡。适合希望让 DSH 对话保持指定角色风格并记住长期信息的用户。需要 DSH Desktop，并使用已配置的模型进行蒸馏和记忆提取。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:72-73","src/client/index.tsx:128-155","src/host/tools.ts:33-74","src/client/distill.tsx:102-124","src/client/manage.tsx:132-175"]}
{"unit_id":"cayan0x__Lume#card-en","repo":"cayan0x/Lume","commit":"67e988d097f3682603d8fbee07185a7394a8349f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Lume adds switchable personas, memory, and style learning to DSH Desktop. Its web client supports persona selection, distillation from text, memory and style tools, and persona card import/export. It uses the user-configured model for distillation and memory extraction.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:72-73","src/client/index.tsx:128-155","src/host/tools.ts:33-74","src/client/distill.tsx:102-124","src/client/manage.tsx:132-175"]}
